---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  locale="en" 
  customTitle="Privacy Policy — EpoxyResin-Calculator.com"
  customDescription="Privacy policy for EpoxyResin-Calculator.com. We operate as a zero-data, client-side local calculation micro-tool."
  showLanguageSelector={false}
>
  <div class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <div class="mb-10 border-b border-slate-200 pb-6">
        <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-cyan-700 hover:text-cyan-800 mb-4">
          ← Back to Calculator
        </a>
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl">
          Privacy Policy
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-2">
          Effective Date: January 1, 2026 • Last Updated: September 2026
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="prose prose-slate text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-6 text-slate-700">
        
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">1. Zero Personal Data Collection</h2>
          <p>
            EpoxyResin-Calculator.com ("we", "us", or "our") operates as a client-side utility micro-tool. We do not require account registration, login credentials, email addresses, payment information, or personal identifiers. You can use all mathematical calculators, volume formulas, and density ratio tables completely anonymously.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">2. Local Browser Execution</h2>
          <p>
            All dimension inputs (Length, Width, Diameter, Depth, Wastage Margins, and Specific Gravities) and resulting volume and weight calculations are computed locally within your browser's runtime memory via client-side JavaScript. None of your entered measurements, mold dimensions, or workshop recipes are transmitted to, stored on, or processed by any external server or third-party database.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">3. Cookies and Tracking Technologies</h2>
          <p>
            We do not use tracking cookies, cross-site profiling trackers, or intrusive advertising telemetry. Our static website files are hosted on Cloudflare Pages, which processes standard transient HTTP networking logs (such as IP addresses and user agents) strictly for DDoS mitigation, edge caching, and server security.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">4. Clipboard Functionality</h2>
          <p>
            The "Copy Workshop Recipe" tool utilizes standard browser Clipboard APIs solely to place the formatted calculation summary onto your device's local clipboard when you deliberately click the button. No clipboard contents are accessed, read, or transmitted.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">5. Contact Information</h2>
          <p>
            If you have questions regarding this privacy policy or our technical implementation, you can contact the engineering team via our public repository or at <span class="font-mono text-cyan-800">support@epoxyresin-calculator.com</span>.
          </p>
        </section>

      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
